config BORE_SCHED
	tristate "BORE (Burst-Oriented Response Enhancer) scheduler"
	depends on ANDROID_VENDOR_HOOKS
	help
	  Penalizes CPU-bound tasks based on their burst time, favouring
	  interactive tasks. Hooks into CFS through the android_vh_bore_*
	  vendor hooks. Can be toggled at runtime with
	  /sys/module/bore_sched/parameters/sched_bore.

	  Based on BORE by Masahito S. and the AxionOS bore_sched module.
